## Effect
{{~ if policy.effect == null ~}}

_The policy rule has no `then.effect`._
{{~ else if policy.effect.kind == "parameter" ~}}

The effect is set by the `{{ policy.effect.parameterName }}` parameter.
{{~ if policy.effect.defaultEffect ~}}

- Default: `{{ policy.effect.defaultEffect }}`
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ if policy.effect.allowedEffects.size > 0 ~}}
- Allowed: {{ code_list policy.effect.allowedEffects }}
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ else if policy.effect.kind == "literal" ~}}

The effect is fixed to `{{ policy.effect.raw }}`.
{{~ else ~}}

The effect is computed by an expression{{ if policy.effect.allowedEffects.size > 0 }} that resolves to one of {{ code_list policy.effect.allowedEffects }}{{ end }}:

```
{{ policy.effect.raw }}
```
{{~ end ~}}
