{{~ if policy.effectDetails.resourceType ~}}

Related resource type: `{{ policy.effectDetails.resourceType }}`{{ if policy.effectDetails.hasExistenceCondition }}, checked with an existence condition{{ end }}{{ if policy.effectDetails.hasDeployment }}, deployed from a template when missing{{ end }}.
{{~ end ~}}
